BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain conditional branching constructs in C: if, if-else, nested if, and else-if ladders with execution flowcharts.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Conditional Branching Constructs in C:) Tj
T*
(   1. Architectural Purpose:) Tj
T*
(   Conditional control structures direct the instruction pointer along alternate execution paths) Tj
T*
(   based on runtime truth-value evaluation \(0 = false, non-zero = true\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Branching Constructs Hierarchy:) Tj
T*
(   a. Simple if Statement:) Tj
T*
(   Syntax: if \(condition\) { statement; }) Tj
T*
(   Execution: Evaluates condition. If non-zero, executes block; otherwise bypasses block.) Tj
T*
(   b. if-else Statement:) Tj
T*
(   Syntax: if \(condition\) { stmt1; } else { stmt2; }) Tj
T*
(   Execution: Mutually exclusive binary fork. Exactly one path executes.) Tj
T*
(   c. Nested if-else Statements:) Tj
T*
(   Placing if-else blocks within parent if or else bodies to model hierarchical decision trees.) Tj
T*
(   d. else-if Ladder:) Tj
T*
(   Multi-path linear progression evaluated sequentially until the first true condition matches;) Tj
T*
(   subsequent branches are ignored.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Flowchart Logic Representation:) Tj
T*
(   [Start] -> [Evaluate Cond 1]) Tj
T*
(   |-- \(True\) --> [Execute Action 1] -------------------> [End Branch]) Tj
T*
(   |-- \(False\) --> [Evaluate Cond 2]) Tj
T*
(   |-- \(True\) --> [Execute Action 2] -> [End Branch]) Tj
T*
(   |-- \(False\) --> [Execute Default] -> [End Branch]) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Demonstrative ANSI C Code:) Tj
T*
(   #include <stdio.h>) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   void classify_ph\(double ph\) {) Tj
T*
(   if \(ph < 0.0 || ph > 14.0\) {) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Invalid pH range: %.2f\\n", ph\);) Tj
T*
(   } else if \(ph < 3.0\) {) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Strongly Acidic \(pH: %.2f\)\\n", ph\);) Tj
T*
(   } else if \(ph < 6.5\) {) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Weakly Acidic \(pH: %.2f\)\\n", ph\);) Tj
T*
(   } else if \(ph <= 7.5\) {) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Neutral Buffer Solution \(pH: %.2f\)\\n", ph\);) Tj
T*
(   } else if \(ph < 11.5\) {) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Weakly Alkaline \(pH: %.2f\)\\n", ph\);) Tj
T*
(   } else {) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Strongly Basic / Alkaline \(pH: %.2f\)\\n", ph\);) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   int main\(void\) {) Tj
T*
(   classify_ph\(2.1\);) Tj
T*
(   classify_ph\(7.35\);) Tj
T*
(   classify_ph\(12.8\);) Tj
T*
ET

