BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze the Dangling-Else Problem in C, detailing compiler resolution rules and defensive coding standards.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   The Dangling-Else Problem and Resolution Rules:) Tj
T*
(   1. Definition of the Ambiguity:) Tj
T*
(   The dangling-else ambiguity arises in nested conditional statements lacking explicit block) Tj
T*
(   braces when the number of 'if' keywords exceeds the number of 'else' keywords:) Tj
T*
(   if \(condition1\)) Tj
T*
(   if \(condition2\)) Tj
T*
(   action1\(\);) Tj
T*
(   else) Tj
T*
(   action2\(\); /* To which 'if' does this 'else' belong? */) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. ANSI C Standard Resolution Rule:) Tj
T*
(   In ANSI / ISO C grammar, the ambiguous 'else' is ASSOCIATED WITH THE CLOSEST PRECEDING 'if') Tj
T*
(   THAT LACKS AN 'else' CLAUSE!) Tj
T*
(   Therefore, the compiler interprets the snippet as:) Tj
T*
(   if \(condition1\) {) Tj
T*
(   if \(condition2\) {) Tj
T*
(   action1\(\);) Tj
T*
(   } else {) Tj
T*
(   action2\(\); /* Belongs to condition2, NOT condition1! */) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
(   If the programmer intended action2\(\) to execute when condition1 is false, a severe logic bug) Tj
T*
(   occurs: action2\(\) will NEVER execute if condition1 is false!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Defensive Coding Standard \(Mandatory Bracing\):) Tj
T*
(   Modern coding standards \(MISRA C, CERT C, Google C Style\) strictly forbid unbraced conditional) Tj
T*
(   statements.) Tj
T*
(   Correct Defensive Pattern:) Tj
T*
(   if \(condition1\) {) Tj
T*
(   if \(condition2\) {) Tj
T*
(   action1\(\);) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
(   } else {) Tj
T*
(   action2\(\); /* Unambiguously bound to condition1 */) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Code Example Demonstrating Logic Failure:) Tj
T*
(   #include <stdio.h>) Tj
T*
(   int main\(void\) {) Tj
T*
(   int enzyme_active = 0;) Tj
T*
(   int substrate_present = 1;) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   /* Flawed unbraced logic */) Tj
T*
(   if \(enzyme_active\)) Tj
T*
(   if \(substrate_present\)) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Reaction progressing.\\n"\);) Tj
T*
ET

endstream
