(   Open Reading Frame \(ORF\) Scanner in C:) Tj
T*
(   1. Biological Logic:) Tj
T*
(   - Protein translation initiates at the Start Codon: ATG.) Tj
T*
(   - Translation continues in triplets \(reading frame of 3 nucleotides\) until encountering a Stop) Tj
T*
(   Codon: TAA, TAG, or TGA.) Tj
T*
(   - Any triplets encountered must maintain a step of 3 relative to the start codon to remain in) Tj
T*
(   the same reading frame!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
