(   [Problem Statement]: Write an ANSI C program to print Pascal's Triangle up to N rows using nested for loops and combinatorial logic.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Pascal's Triangle Generation with Nested Loops:) Tj
T*
(   1. Mathematical Properties:) Tj
T*
(   - Each row n corresponds to binomial coefficients: C\(n, k\) = n! / \(k! * \(n - k\)!\).) Tj
T*
(   - Invariant: First and last element of each row is 1.) Tj
T*
(   - Recurrence relation between consecutive terms in row n:) Tj
T*
(   C\(n, k\) = C\(n, k - 1\) * \(n - k + 1\) / k.) Tj
T*
(   - This allows computing row elements in O\(1\) time without computing large factorials!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Complete ANSI C Source Code:) Tj
T*
(   #include <stdio.h>) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   void print_pascals_triangle\(int rows\) {) Tj
T*
(   for \(int i = 0; i < rows; i++\) {) Tj
T*
(   /* Print leading spaces for triangular formatting */) Tj
T*
(   for \(int space = 0; space < rows - i - 1; space++\) {) Tj
T*
(   printf\(" "\);) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   long long val = 1;) Tj
T*
(   for \(int j = 0; j <= i; j++\) {) Tj
T*
(   printf\("%6lld", val\);) Tj
T*
(   val = val * \(i - j\) / \(j + 1\); /* Direct recurrence */) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
(   printf\("\\n"\);) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   int main\(void\) {) Tj
T*
(   int total_rows = 7;) Tj
T*
(   printf\("=== Pascal's Triangle \(Combinatorial Coefficients\) ===\\n"\);) Tj
T*
(   print_pascals_triangle\(total_rows\);) Tj
T*
